Adds a prominent 'Today's Review: N cards · ~M min · Start review' brief as the single
primary action; collapses the header's button cluster into a '+' menu + settings. Deck/
test/mind-map resource rows with an explicit 'Study'/'Start'/'Open' action + a '•••'
overflow (Cards/Match/move/delete). Retention sparkline calmed (1px line, no glow) leading
with present recall + a hover crosshair forecast. Review surface: 'N of M' progress, neutral
category dots, crimson only on 'Again'. The 12-month heatmap moves to the bottom, collapsed
into a 'Review history' summary. FSRS/deck-file/test/mind-map logic preserved; typecheck clean.
